    "created_at": "2023-04-06T16:25:30Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-04-06T16:25:30Z",
    "body": "Fair point, though personally I think I'd still prefer to have all these proposals in one place. There are some nice benefits to this organization (e.g. the timeline of feature additions, and _why_ features were developed, is much easier to trace and therefore much more transparent) and I think we can mitigate the risks you mentioned by presenting these in a less official-sounding way.\r\n\r\nIn that vein, I've renamed this folder to `proposals/`, which I think better conveys what these documents are anyways",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
